    "body": "<header>\n<h1 data-aid=\"128477408\" id=\"title1\"><strong>Jesus Christ, Family of</strong></h1>\n</header>\n<div class=\"body-block\">\n<nav class=\"index\">\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477410\" id=\"p1\">his mother and his <span class=\"key-word\">brethren</span> stood without, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/12?lang=eng&amp;id=p46#p46\">Matt. 12:46</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/3?lang=eng&amp;id=p31#p31\">Mark 3:31</a>; <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/luke/8?lang=eng&amp;id=p19#p19\">Luke 8:19</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477412\" id=\"p2\">is not his mother called Mary? and his <span class=\"key-word\">brethren</span>, James, and Joses, and Simon, and Judas, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/matt/13?lang=eng&amp;id=p55#p55\">Matt. 13:55</a> (<a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/mark/6?lang=eng&amp;id=p3#p3\">Mark 6:3</a>).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477414\" id=\"p3\">went down to Capernaum, he, and his mother, and his <span class=\"key-word\">brethren</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/2?lang=eng&amp;id=p12#p12\">John 2:12</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477415\" id=\"p4\">saith he to the disciple, Behold thy <span class=\"key-word\">mother</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/john/19?lang=eng&amp;id=p27#p27\">John 19:27</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477417\" id=\"p5\">continued with one accord … with … Mary the mother of Jesus, and with his <span class=\"key-word\">brethren</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/acts/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p14#p14\">Acts 1:14</a>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p class=\"entry\" data-aid=\"128477419\" id=\"p6\">saw I none, save James the Lord’s <span class=\"key-word\">brother</span>, <a class=\"scripture-ref\" href=\"/study/scriptures/nt/gal/1?lang=eng&amp;id=p19#p19\">Gal. 1:19</a>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</nav>\n</div>",
